<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Oakfields in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Oakfields in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakfields Thoroughbreds and Leisure  Industries Ltd said on Friday that talks were in progresss which,  if successfully concluded, could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings  until further notice.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
